      "text": "MECEE-BL · MBBS & BDS · Nepal Mock papers built to the real MECEE-BL blueprint 200 questions, three hours, +1 right and −0.25 wrong, Mental Agility Test included. Every paper is marked the way the Medical Education Commission marks yours — and every question you drop comes back with a worked solution and a tutor that has read it. Full MECEE-BL mocks AI tutor on your mistakes Ranked grand mocks Revision from what you got wrong Start practising free Browse mock tests Free forever · no card · nothing auto-renews Questions 2,286 Model sets 12 Study notes 40 EXAM BLUEPRINT MECEE-BL Full Paper 200 q",
