      "text": "Every subject at its official weight The bank is written against the Medical Education Commission blueprint down to the per-topic question counts, so practice time lands where the marks are. Zoology 40 questions in MECEE-BL Botany 40 questions in MECEE-BL Chemistry 50 questions in MECEE-BL Physics 50 questions in MECEE-BL Mental Agility Test 20 questions in MECEE-BL",
